<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/207001AKHHGDGSDHTJPMBMPMVDMKLNJQK> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "ABBA - blahblahblah: A Swedish Disco Holiday Comedy Special";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"ItalicText\">Presented by The Comedy Department - the team that brought you Middle Aged Boy Band and Canadian Steam</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In the grand tradition of the classic celebrity Christmas special, the world's favourite Swedish supergroup is taking over your holidays - for one night only! \"ABBA\" is hosting their very own holiday variety special, complete with heartfelt songs, glittering costumes, questionable choreography, and just a touch of international tension. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Watch as Agnetha, Björn, Benny, and Anni-Frid are determined to deliver the perfect Christmas special - no matter what. Nothing is planned, anything can happen, and the band is holding it together with gold tinsel and sheer Swedish determination. Will they pull it off? Or will the whole thing end up a big SOS? <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It's a wild, improvised comedy and musical parody where ABBA's greatest hits collide with holiday mayhem. Expect spot-on musical performances, laugh-out-loud comedy, and plenty of chances to sing along to the ABBA hits you (almost) remember. The harmonies are nearly there, but the commitment is absolute. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">\"We had perma-grin throughout the show... so many scenes that were so funny and original... everyone howling with laughter. Highly recommended and memorable!\"</span> — TripAdvisor Review <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Whether you're a lifelong Dancing Queen or discovering ABBA for the first time, this is the closest thing Christmas has to a fever dream. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Comedy Department is a TripAdvisor Travellers' Choice Award winner three years running (2024–26). <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Cast includes award-winning comedians and performers Denise Jones, Michael Teigen, Jennifer Hayes, and Matt Clarke.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mamma Mia, Let It Snow Again!</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-11-20T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/files/01b96dc9-3036-4e3c-b090-52d771d58c93.jpg>;
