<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/212601ADPLJQHKKJQTLTBDSBRDTJCKCTR> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Annual General Meeting 2026";
  schema:description """
	The Sid Williams Theatre Society's board of directors and management will review the past fiscal year (July 2025 to June 2026) of operations, followed by a reception in the lounge featuring refreshments and dessert.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The AGM agenda includes:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li>A message from our board president</li><li>Presentation of our financial statements and the board treasurer’s report</li><li>Nominations to the board</li><li>Student bursaries and other reports</li><li>Updates on recent technical upgrades</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Plus there will be draw prizes for many upcoming events!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>AGM materials will be available to access digitally and in hard copy for pickup at our box office.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For those who cannot attend in person, there will be a recording of the meeting to view available on request.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Members not able to attend in person who have a question that they would like to put to management and/or board of directors, please email it to <span class=\"BoldText\">board@sidtheatre.com</span>.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">RSVP TO RESERVE YOUR TICKET</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please RSVP by reserving your ticket online, or contacting our box office by email<span><br/></span>boxoffice@sidtheatre.com or phone 250-338-2430 ext 1.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Only valid members will be eligible to vote.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We hope you'll join us!
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-11-24T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
