<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/208001ASRLTMRSNVTRTCDHCKTPPGPMCGL> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Billy & Elton - The Legacy";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Billy & Elton - The Legacy</span> <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Experience the music, energy and unforgettable songs of Elton John and Billy Joel as Billy & Elton – The Legacy brings two legendary performers to life on stage! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring incredible live performances of fan favourites including <span class=\"ItalicText\">Rocket Man, Tiny Dancer, I’m Still Standing, Crocodile Rock, Candle in the Wind, Piano Man, Uptown Girl, My Life, Only the Good Die Young, It’s Still Rock and Roll to Me, Scenes from an Italian Restaurant</span> and many more! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With powerhouse vocals, outstanding musicianship and the larger-than-life personalities of two of music’s greatest icons, Billy & Elton - The Legacy is an exciting musical journey packed with timeless hits, memories and plenty of rock ’n’ roll. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Mick Dalla-Vee as Elton John and Michael Sicoly as Billy Joel</span> bring these legendary artists to life with the sound, spirit and energy that have thrilled audiences around the world. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With a combined history of performing for audiences across Canada and internationally, the performers have taken their music to stages from London, England to Toronto, Vancouver, Calgary and Edmonton, and from Mexico, Costa Rica and the Dominican Republic to communities throughout Western Canada. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Two legendary artists. Two incredible performers. One unforgettable night of music.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Don’t miss <span class=\"BoldText\">Billy & Elton - The Legacy</span> - a spectacular celebration of the songs that have become the soundtrack of generations!
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-02-12T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/files/9bf66cfd-f839-4805-93ea-520e86579f23.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/sidwilliams/location/201AGBHDRLQHNHPHKKMPKLGPMDRDTDMVL>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/sidwilliams/organization/lake-house-productions>;
  schema:url <https://www.sidwilliamstheatre.com/events/billy-elton-the-legacy/>;
  schema:offers _:8669c22bfe5949afb8f6b916737cab011573;
  schema:keywords "Concert";
  schema:duration "PT105M";
  schema:endDate "2027-02-12T20:45:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

