<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/207201AVJVGKMTLPDNBLCPRDDGDGLNRJN> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "I'm A Soulman - A Tribute To The Blues Brothers";
  schema:description """
	I'm A Soul Man - A Tribute to the Blues Brothers <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Chris and Geoff Dahl, real brothers from London, Ontario, Canada mastered their craft as bluesmen in the early 90's while performing and recording with several R&B<span class=\"ItalicText\">Blues</span>Pop recording acts including BLACK AVALON (A&M Records) CASSANDRA VASIK (Epic Records) THE BUSHDOCTORS (A&M Records), MELODY DURRANT (Motown<span class=\"ItalicText\">Universal) and the world famous OLD CHICAGO'S BLUES BAND (Speakeasy Records)! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>During this time, the brothers (who both sing and play all instruments including guitar, bass, drums, keyboards and harmonica) shared the stage with some of the world's top R&B legends including Buddy Guy, BB King, Chicago Pete, Downchild Blues Band, Powder Blues Band, The Contours, The Miracles, Martha Reeves, Dutch Mason & Jeff Healy to name a few...thus gaining a wealth of on stage experience and picking up many of the <span class=\"BoldText\">tricks of the trade</span> from the masters of the craft! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It was in 1994 that the real brothers first donned the stage gear made famous by John Belushi and Dan Aykroyd ,during an impromptu Halloween performance at the Old Chicago's blues festival. Following this performance the brothers never looked back and began working as a much heralded full time R&B tribute 6 under the name of THE SOUL BROTHERS! the Ultimate Tribute to BLUES, RYTHYM & BLUES AND SOUL! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This 2 hour live SOUL BROTHERS show has taken the brothers all over the world performing in blues festivals, arena concerts, and with the D.N.D </span>U.S.O. SHOW TOURS entertaining the troops in remote locations throughout the world. They have also performed as an impressive Blues Brothers tribute during several extended runs with the Canadian based LEGENDS ALIVE, LEGENDS IN CONCERT USA and the European based STARS IN CONCERT tribute show. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In 2013, the Soul Brothers, Chris with his 4 octave vocal range and Geoff with his harmonica wizardry, continue to bring their power of the blues to stages around the world, performing all the hits of legendary r&b recording artists The Blues Brothers, The Isley Brothers, Sam and Dave, James Brown, Ray Charles and more…
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-02-05T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/files/68ed42fc-3236-427b-8ae0-ac60c72eb5e0.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/sidwilliams/location/201AGBHDRLQHNHPHKKMPKLGPMDRDTDMVL>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/sidwilliams/organization/paquette-productions>;
  schema:url <https://www.sidwilliamstheatre.com/events/im-a-soulman-a-tribute-to-the-blues-brothers/>;
  schema:offers _:8669c22bfe5949afb8f6b916737cab011596;
  schema:keywords "Concert";
  schema:duration "PT120M";
  schema:endDate "2027-02-05T21:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

