<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/207401ACTJGMCGVKLSVLCVCJMRSJTNRQK> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Pop Goes The Sixties!";
  schema:description """
	BackBeat Entertainment is proud to present, <span class=\"BoldText\">POP GOES THE SIXTIES!</span> A live variety show and multimedia presentation, celebrating the music of six legendary musical groups, in one incredible show, lovingly performed by Backbeat, Canada’s most authentic musical tribute to the 1960s. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It's a magical evening of top 10 hits from The Beatles, The Beach Boys, The Rolling Stones, The Who, The Monkees, and Creedence Clearwater Revival. You'll be transported back in time to re-live the sights and sounds of a sixties pop musical show that is sure to have you tapping your toes, singing along, and cheering all night long. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With that sixties sizzling sound, dazzling video on three projection screens that pop, and a special nostalgic flare of sixties video footage that will take you back to a much simpler time when music changed the world we live in. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>As Ed Sullivan called it... \"A really big shoe!\". Don't miss this once in a lifetime event… <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get your tickets now!
""";
