<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/203201ADKNKBGPDLHRMGBVGGNQCGHDDRD> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Celtic Tenors";
  schema:description """
	The Celtic Tenors - charismatic, globe-trotting, and Ireland’s most successful classical crossover group. Featuring Matthew Gilsenan, Daryl Simpson, and George Hutton, the trio shares a love for music, harmony, and laughter on every stage. guaranteeing a performance that sparkles with professionalism, warmth, and good humour. Their genuine love for music shines through every song - from haunting Celtic ballads and exhilarating classics, to a cappellas and contemporary favourites. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With a polished international reputation and over a million CDs sold worldwide, The Celtic Tenors offer something truly unique: the world-class skill, range, and artistry of acclaimed tenors, combined with the personality, authenticity, and charm of genuine performers. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>At every show, you get more than just a concert - you’ll enjoy an evening to savour, filled with laughter and unforgettable harmonies. Matthew, Daryl, and new member George are dedicated to their craft, always striving for excellence - yet their infectious spirit and joy for music ensure every performance is fun to the max! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Three distinctive solo voices - coming together as one unforgettable Tenor Sound.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Find out more about the Vancouver Island Symphony from their website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://https://vancouverislandsymphony.com/\">vancouverislandsymphony.com</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">GET THE SERIES!</span><span><br/></span>3-Concert Series available including:<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mischief, Madness & Mystery, Winter Glow and Aretha, Whitney & Tina!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>You also have the option to add <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Celtic Tenors</span>, a special Vancouver Island Symphony presentation, to the 3-Concert Series Package!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Click on any Vancouver Island Symphony Event, then click the white button that says \"GET EVENT PACKAGES.\" From there, you have the option to click the black button that says \"GET THE SERIES PLUS THE CELTIC TENORS\" or stick with the 3-concert series by clicking \"GET TICKETS.\" <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Reminder:</span> you will be asked to \"Enter the number of packages you wish to purchase.\" Here, click the small arrow in the text box until you see the number of tickets you would like PER EVENT (for example: if you select \"2\" that means you want 2 tickets to <span class=\"ItalicText\">each</span> series event.) <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Series packages available for a limited time. 
""";
