  schema:name "The Sheepdogs - Out All Night Tour";
  schema:description """
	The Sheepdogs are Canada’s leaders in rock ’n’ roll entertainment. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Four-time JUNO Award winners from Saskatoon, with multiple Gold and Platinum records to their name, they blend killer harmonies, dual-guitar wizardry, and a stage presence that turns audiences into true believers. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Sheepdogs deliver the real goods: rock music that’s loud, loose, and full of soul. They’ve taken their unmistakable sound from bars and roadhouses to festival fields and arenas around the world, earning a well-deserved reputation as one of the most electrifying live bands today. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With 13 releases - including the recent companion EPs Paradise Alone and Hell Together - the band continues to prove that the spirit of classic rock will never die. Now, thanks to their own label, Right On Records, they are masters of their own destiny. Their new single, “Nobody But You,” is the first taste of new music to come and proof that The Sheepdogs are charging full steam ahead into 2026 and beyond.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>VIP PACKAGES - Options will appear in cart before checkout.</h2>Want to hang with The Sheepdogs before the show? <span class=\"BoldText\">Add a VIP package with your concert ticket for a group Q&A, a stripped-back acoustic song, and the Wild Card Hang.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The band travels with a full-size game show wheel that Gold VIP guests spin to choose surprise activities. The band might write a song about a guest, draw a portrait, or the wheel might send things in another direction entirely. Silver guests join the group experience and shared activities.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>GOLD VIP: $140 per person</h2><span class=\"ItalicText\">Includes all taxes and fees</span><span><br/></span><ul><li>Q&A + Wild Card Hang: spin the full-size game show wheel to unlock a surprise activity. Only Gold guests spin the wheel.</li><li>One-on-one time with the band, including an individual Polaroid photo and selfies.</li><li>Exclusive merchandise: a signed, limited-edition <span class=\"ItalicText\">Keep Out Of The Storm LP</span> and an exclusive live 10\" vinyl record (Exclusively available to VIP attendees, not sold in stores).</li><li>One VIP laminate and lanyard.</li><li>Pre-show merchandise shopping before the venue opens to the public.</li><li>Priority entry into the venue.</li></ul><span><br/></span><h2>SILVER VIP: $85.25 per person</h2><span class=\"ItalicText\">Includes all taxes and fees</span><span><br/></span><ul><li>Q&A + Wild Card Hang: attend the group experience and shared activities as Gold guests spin the wheel.</li><li>Exclusive merchandise: a signed, limited-edition <span class=\"ItalicText\">Keep Out Of The Storm LP</span> and an exclusive live 10\" vinyl record (Exclusively available to VIP attendees, not sold in stores).</li><li>One VIP laminate and lanyard.</li><li>Pre-show merchandise shopping before the venue opens to the public.</li><li>Priority entry into the venue.</li></ul><span><br/></span><h2>VIP Purchaser Terms & Disclaimer</h2>The VIP experience is an optional upgrade and does not include a concert ticket. A valid ticket for the corresponding show, purchased separately through the authorized ticketing outlet or venue box office, is required for entry into the concert and to participate in any VIP activities.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The VIP Experience is non-transferable and not for resale or reassignment. Any attempt to resell, auction, or otherwise transfer the VIP Experience (in whole or in part) may result in cancellation of the purchase without refund.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All VIP purchasers must present valid photo identification matching the original order at check-in. Entry to the VIP experience may be denied if proper identification or valid concert ticket(s) are not provided.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>By purchasing, you acknowledge that event details (including time, location, and included amenities) are subject to change or cancellation at the discretion of the promoter, artist, or venue. Refunds will only be issued in accordance with the stated refund policy for the event<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
