<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/212801ARJDKNGRCPPLDNPLVCPGPRRGBNP> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Valley Girls Dance: Sugar & Spice";
  schema:description """
	<h2>SUGAR & SPICE </h2><span><br/></span>Sweet? Usually. Spicy? Always. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>On December 5th the Valley Girls are taking over the Sid Williams Theatre; big city entertainment with a small town vibe. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A high energy heels dance production packed with bold visuals, fierce performances, an epic soundtrack and a few surprises. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>But the real magic goes beyond the stage. Behind the heels, hair whips, and booty shakin’ is a community of women building confidence, breaking out of comfort zones, celebrating every body, and lifting each other up! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Sugar & Spice</span> brings both worlds together. An unforgettable night of entertainment with a whole lot of heart behind it. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A little sugar, a LOT of spice, and a night you’ll never forget.
""";
