<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/212201AQRKCNSGJPPDMQNHNTNDDKLLLJP> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "VIRTUAL EVENT - Made in Canada: Part 1";
  schema:description """
	<h1>Virutal, Livestreamed Event</h1><span><br/></span>Just in Time Choirs celebrate Canada’s rich musical history with their Fall 2026 concert - <span class=\"BoldText\">“Made in Canada: Part 1”</span>. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>An homage to Canadian artists and songs, from folk to pop and everything in between. Featuring beloved favourites from household names and fresh new sounds from up and coming artists, the choirs’ rendition of these numbers will fill their audiences with pride. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In the spring, they’ll be hosting their second concert, “Made in Canada: Part 2” continuing the theme of celebrating the outstanding musical contribution Canadian artists have made over the years, and continue to make. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>But right now, the choir family invites you to join them for “Made in Canada: Part 1” and to be a part of the ongoing joy that is <span class=\"BoldText\">Just in Time Choirs.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Livestream Access</span></span><span><br/></span>To access the Livestream Video, follow the link sent to your email address, following the purchase of 1 or more tickets. 
""";
