<http://www.spektrix.com/sidwilliams/event/210201AQHDGPQPCPVBVPMTPPKKNBCTSHV> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Warren Miller - Days Off";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Also supported by the Vancouver Island Society for Adaptive Snowsports</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This fall, drop in on <span class=\"BoldText\">Warren Miller’s 77th film, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Days Off</span></span>. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Follow host Katie Burrell as the world’s best athletes show you what they do on their days off—no agenda, no competition, just pure, unscripted joy. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Embark on a global journey from heli-drops in Alaska and high-alpine mountaineering in Chamonix to the legendary powder of Hokkaido, Japan. Take a ride down Banff’s infamous skijoring course, hit the slopes of Deer Valley, and charge Canada’s finest in Revelstoke, Whistler, and Pemberton. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Days Off</span> captures the raw, unfiltered heart of mountain culture—a pure celebration of skiing for skiing’s sake and the joy of making time for what matters most. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Winter’s greatest tradition is back.
""";
